\begin_layout Standard
Bulk hBN glues inert sheets of hexagonal boron and nitrogen lattices together
 with van der Waals' bonding, similar to that of graphite.
 The lattice parameters of hBN have values of 
\series bold
a 
\series default
= 2.50 Å and 
\series bold
