key "nellist2000theprinciples"

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
I_{coh}(r)=|\psi(r)\bigotimes P(r)|^{2}
\end{equation}

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This is the general case for coherent imaging, used in both BF STEM and
 high resolution TEM (HRTEM).
 If we assume that the specimen is a 
