key "archanjo2012theuse,bell2009precision,buchheim2016understanding,hemamouche2014fibpatterning,2015towardtwodimensional,morin2012fibcarving,wang2016layerbylayer"

\end_inset

.
 However, with a better understanding of ion beam interactions with these
 novel materials, heterostructures may ultimately be prototyped, at least
 partly, in the FIB chamber.
 Figure 
